  "summary": "Malicious code in agora402-payment-utils (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (postinstall.js) silently POSTs a JSON payload to hxxps://webhook[.]site/unique-id-here containing the package name, a hardcoded Ethereum wallet address (0xA930Ca05ea5548aE8ea0817087833A96453BED08), the current timestamp, and the installer's working directory (process.cwd()). The request is fired on install with errors silently swallowed, exfiltrating host metadata to a webhook[.]site endpoint.",
